<title>USA: Ensco says jackup rig rates up 62 pct.</title>
<headline>Ensco says jackup rig rates up 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ensco International said dayrates for its jackup fleet rose 62 percent year on year in the second quarter of 1997 to an average 29,600 per day and utilization rose to 95 percent from 88 percent.</p>
<p>The company reported second quarter earnings per share of $0.74 against $0.34 a year ago and this compares with analysts' forecasts of $0.68 for the quarter.</p>
